Changes in MAX Patches
----------------------

- The collection is maintained and released independently, under the name MAX Patches.
- Bundles are signed with a MAX key, not the Morphe key. The public half is published beside each
  release and is what MAX Patcher verifies.
- Compatibility is declared per app version with evidence, in COMPATIBILITY.md. Nothing is marked
  supported because upstream said so.
- The eight patches that depend on NavigationBarHookPatch are tracked separately, because they are
  all affected by one defect on YouTube 21.45.82.

"Morphe" is used here only descriptively, to say what this collection is compatible with.

